	(text_box "Max battery input voltage: 16.8V\nMax ADC pin input voltage: 3.3V (use 3.2V for a small safety factor)\nDesired Voltage Divider Ratio: 0.1905\nVoltage Divider Ratio chosen:\n100k / (100k + 422k) = 0.1916"
